n that working arrangements are the participant''s to set", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "working arrangements are yours to set"}], "source_sheet": {"d5_situation_class": "SC-D5-7", "workplace_demand": "Preparing a working arrangement for two team members jointly named on one deliverable while a people process runs between them.", "relevant_conduct": "The position stated as the participant''s own; whether the other position was asked about; which shared items were named; what was proposed; what change to the participant''s own position was stated; whether an agreement and its recording were stated; what was stated about the difference continuing.", "irrelevant_conduct": "Everything about the complaint itself. It is the condition that makes the working arrangement a D5 situation and it is never the record.", "stated_standard": null, "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": null, "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named, and no counterpart is named.", "sensitivity_flag": "SENSITIVE_CONTENT", "permitted_administration_variance": "Accommodations are recorded with the submission; the window may be extended as an accommodation and the extension is recorded.", "unsupported_inferences": "Any view of the complaint, its merits, either party''s conduct or credibility, or what occurred; that separating the parties is protective or avoidant; anything about sensitivity.", "compatibility_class": "S3-ASYNC-SUBMISSION", "designated_positions": [{"id": "DP1", "text": "the exchanges are routed through the participant so the two need not interact directly"}, {"id": "DP2", "text": "the deliverable is re-divided so no exchange is required"}, {"id": "DP3", "text": "the arrangement is unchanged and the people function''s process runs alongside"}], "designated_enquiries": [{"id": "DE1", "text": "what each party needs to complete their part of the deliverable"}, {"id": "DE2", "text": "what the people function permits in terms of working arrangements"}, {"id": "DE3", "text": "what the deliverable''s two exchange points require. **NO DESIGNATED ENQUIRY TOUCHES THE COMPLAINT"}], "shared_items": [{"id": "SI1", "text": "the deliverable due in three weeks"}, {"id": "SI2", "text": "the two exchange points the work requires"}, {"id": "SI3", "text": "the people function''s instruction that working arrangements are the participant''s to set"}], "available_options": [{"id": "AO1", "text": "exchanges routed through the participant"}, {"id": "AO2", "text": "the deliverable re-divided"}, {"id": "AO3", "text": "the date moved"}, {"id": "AO4", "text": "advice on the arrangement asked of the people function"}], "available_routes": [], "agreement_contents": [{"id": "AC1", "text": "the working arrangement"}, {"id": "AC2", "text": "who does what at each exchange point"}, {"id": "AC3", "text": "what is recorded and with whom"}], "counterpart_role": "The two team members and the people function.", "counterpart_position": "Neither party has asked for a change.", "difference_established": "Two people jointly named on a deliverable requiring exchange, with a process running between them.", "authority_relation": "The people function runs the complaint process and has directed no investigation; working arrangements are the participant''s.", "recording_route": "The program record and a note to the people function.", "persistence_point": "The deliverable in three weeks; the process has no completion date.", "list_note": "Not selectable in available_routes, because a route a submission names is proposed, not used: separate written notes to each party about the arrangement; a note to the people function; a written arrangement circulated to both.", "source_note": "Highest review standard: Demo-19 was retired from both D2 and D3 because its subject is a complaint about another person''s conduct. That is why it belongs in D5 — and it is the source most likely in the whole estate to produce a record about the complainant, the respondent or the allegation rather than about the participant. three people appear in this source and none of them is A subject of the record. No question observes any of them. No statement names any of them. No rendered sentence may describe the complaint''s substance, either party''s credibility, or any view of what occurred. It must not be approved without the fairness drafting test discharged by someone who has read this note, and it must not be the first D5 source served in any pilot. No route brings the two parties together, and A submission proposing one is recorded as an unlisted route under Q-D5-06 A2 — not as A judgment about the participant.", "situation_class_label": "A difference between two other parties affecting work held", "observation_mode_label": "work_sample", "ai_use": "AI_USE_DECLARATION_REQUIRED", "submission_window_days": 3}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D5-S3-007", "stage_code": "S3", "source_version_hash": "08177b3f9f85f4f4d3548c66de6104c04f75f1928234b5e8a2ffaf1cf3bbf39c", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": "", "rewording": {"register": "CR-312", "authority": "Tony Mofoke written delegation of 23 October 2026 (CR-219)", "rule": "D5-69 (CR-232): the counterpart role label is not the subject of a verb in a bound family item", "family": "available_options", "item": "AO4", "before": "the people function asked to advise on the arrangement", "after": "advice on the arrangement asked of the people function", "package_source_digest": "816d5256f01e9e8c53cd12b512c9e1a02aa15e86bf9bfa25b399e6adbf9b1f35"}}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object o
    where o.identifier = 'SRC-D5-S3-007' and o.family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family and not exists (select 1 from public.t3a_d1_content_version v where v.content_object_id = o.content_object_id);
